Seeded bug X for task T07.
Applied automatically by `experiment/timer.sh start T07 <arm>` on branch task/T07.
Never commit this patch to main.

Defect: resolveTask() silently returns the first partial match instead of
refusing an ambiguous request. A destructive command such as `delete report`
can therefore hit the wrong task when several titles contain "report".

The 191 tests in tests/ do not cover the multi-match branch, so the existing
suite stays green with this patch applied. Only experiment/tests-visible/T07
detects it.

diff --git a/src/app/application.ts b/src/app/application.ts
